            "topic": "ECIS · EARNINGS SIGNALS · S14",
            "segment": "ECIS — Episode 14",
            "command": "ECIS answers every time it is asked, and some of those answers are worth less than the others. Can it put an honest interval around each prediction, refuse the ones it can't stand behind, notice when one company's language starts showing up in its peers, and take a question in plain English?",
