    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "AGENTIC LAYER",
      "narration_text": "All of this is now queryable in natural language. An agentic layer built on LangGraph decomposes questions into sub-tasks, routes them to the right tools — signal retrieval, cross-company analytics, SHAP explanations — and synthesizes structured responses. Ask which companies show deterioration signals, and the agent scans the full corpus. Ask why a particular company was flagged, and it pulls the SHAP attributions. The system doesn't just compute — it converses.",
