    {
      "beat_id": "B06",
      "act": "CLOSE",
      "narration_text": "Nineteen phases in, the system now quantifies its own uncertainty, abstains when it should, tracks how language shifts propagate across companies and supply chains, and answers questions about everything it knows. The most important upgrade wasn't a new model or a new feature. It was teaching the system to say: I'm not confident enough to call this one. Next week, we keep building.",
